# A manual with nobody balancing it (and a twitchy balance for this test) tips over: bail.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
cmd 0 setData physics.combo.manualInstability 30
hold up 0..80
tap up 100
tap down 104
run 400
expect event manualStart within 104..106
expect event bail within 106..200
expect no event comboLanded
expect event danger{why=manual balance} within 165..185
